			title: "&f5. Finding Constellation Papers",
			description: [
				"&7Loot chests in Dungeons, Mineshafts, Strongholds, Desert Pyramids, Jungle Temples, Shipwrecks, or Astral Ruins/Dig Sites (roughly a 1-in-3 chance per chest) to find &fConstellation Papers&7!",
				"",
