				"&8• &aBy Day: &7Look for a noticeable circular bare patch of grass where all flowers and tall grass are naturally cleared away.",
				"&8• &9By Night (With Astrolabe): &7Look through your Astrolabe and scroll your &eMouse Wheel&7 to adjust the angle marker—when close to a discovered constellation's angle, the Astrolabe reveals a &fglowing vertical pillar of starlight&7 rising from the exact center of the Focal Point!",
